@base_url = http://localhost:3000
@access_token = REPLACE_AFTER_LOGIN
@email = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_EMAIL

### Health: real database read
GET {{base_url}}/health

### Register (confirm email before login if confirmation is enabled)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Nguyen Van A","email":"{{email}}","password":"GymflowDemo2026!"}

### Login: copy access_token into the variable above
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"GymflowDemo2026!"}

### Profile
GET {{base_url}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Dynamic rewards
GET {{base_url}}/rewards

### Reward detail
GET {{base_url}}/rewards/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Membership catalogue
GET {{base_url}}/memberships

### Trainers
GET {{base_url}}/trainers

### Balance
GET {{base_url}}/points/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### History
GET {{base_url}}/points/history?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Must fail with 401
GET {{base_url}}/me
Authorization: Bearer forged-token

### Activity (all four histories)
GET {{base_url}}/activity?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create a membership order: use a NEW UUID for a new intent, reuse for retries
POST {{base_url}}/membership-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"membership_id":"10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","idempotency_key":"60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"}

### Admin only: issue QR, copy token into check-in body
POST {{base_url}}/admin/qr-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"gym_id":"1","minutes":15}

### Check-in as member with active membership
POST {{base_url}}/gym/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"paste-token-from-admin-QR"}

### Current session / occupancy
GET {{base_url}}/gym/session
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Occupancy
GET {{base_url}}/gym/1/occupancy
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Hourly occupancy, today in Vietnam
GET {{base_url}}/gym/1/hourly
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Redeem: reuse key on retry, new UUID for next redemption
POST {{base_url}}/redemptions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reward_id":"20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","idempotency_key":"60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002"}

### Available trainer slots (replace date)
GET {{base_url}}/trainers/30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/slots?date=2026-10-10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Admin pending work
GET {{base_url}}/admin/dashboard?limit=20&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
